Nebo.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/3993-0
00:25:12.827 --> 00:25:13.187
<v Filip Mežibridskij>Ano.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/4000-0
