66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/5976-0
00:37:00.240 --> 00:37:00.520
Dobře.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/5981-1
00:37:03.485 --> 00:37:04.327
<v Tereza Šr&#225;mkov&#225;>nákladama, tak.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/5987-0
