66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/6098-0
00:37:53.717 --> 00:37:54.177
<v Tereza Šr&#225;mkov&#225;>Taky díky.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/6110-0
