<v Martina Medlenov&#225;>To je ohrožení úplně.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/13487-0
01:21:55.770 --> 01:21:56.050
No.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/13490-0
01:21:56.280 --> 01:21:56.640
Trvat.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/13488-0
01:21:56.520 --> 01:21:57.120
No a.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/13506-0
