66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15479-0
01:34:19.237 --> 01:34:20.597
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Se, jakoby obsluhuje ten 1.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15510-0
01:34:22.017 --> 01:34:25.301
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Nebo tak jako,
