66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15510-2
01:34:29.452 --> 01:34:31.497
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Je to v backlogu u Pavla růžičky.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15568-0
01:34:35.007 --> 01:34:39.727
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>AS tím 3 logem ty dropsóny,
