66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15598-1
01:35:08.464 --> 01:35:08.970
<v @1>seznamu?</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15602-0
01:35:09.960 --> 01:35:10.640
Hrátler.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15609-0
01:35:12.000 --> 01:35:13.360
Tak podle.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15629-0
01:35:14.627 --> 01:35:17.377
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Já jsem to tam zatím nechala,
