66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15685-0
01:35:44.597 --> 01:35:44.917
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>Ano.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15694-0
