66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15741-0
01:36:04.150 --> 01:36:04.470
Jo.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15797-2
01:36:06.513 --> 01:36:11.078
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>že se nevejdeme do úžic do zdip to jsme
tam měli v tom projektu.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15755-0
01:36:08.370 --> 01:36:08.730
No.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15764-0
01:36:10.920 --> 01:36:11.640
<v @1>Tady furt je.</v>

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/15797-3
01:36:11.078 --> 01:36:15.293
<v Lucie Brejchov&#225;>O tom jsme se bavili,
