Tak jo.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/17508-0
01:46:29.380 --> 01:46:30.540
A tady to ten ta.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/17509-0
01:46:32.110 --> 01:46:32.390
Takže.

66e3c573-bb27-482c-9211-6e19888e5498/17522-0
01:46:33.390 --> 01:46:37.150
<v @1>No tohle já to zajímalo, to jsem právě,
